        "fields": {
          "message": {
            "kind": "VALUE",
            "value": "WHAT DOES A $10 BAZI READING INCLUDE?\nOne question. A personal written answer in English.\nHere’s what you receive:\n1. A focused response\nAn answer centred on the one question and background you share.\n2. Relevant chart themes and three observations\nPatterns to reflect on in the context of your situation.\n3. A practical next step\nOne action to consider, plus something to avoid as you think through your decision.\nYour reading is manually prepared in English and delivered within 24 hours. You can request one written clarification within 7 days.\n$10 one-time. No subscription. This service covers one BaZi question; it does not include a home Feng Shui consultation or guarantee a future outcome.\nWant to see the format before booking? Our website includes a clearly labelled fictional sample, so you can explore the structure without using anyone’s private reading.\nView the sample and booking details:\nhttps://reading.easternwisdomstudio.com/en\n#BaZi #EasternWisdom"
          },
